OL,3,GNEWSAMan working on boat carries out
OL,4,Aharbour car rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who saved the elderly driver of a
OL,7,Fcar which became submerged in a harbour
OL,8,Fhas described how he went "straight
OL,9,Fback to work" following the rescue.
OL,11,FPeter Rimmer from Southport was working
OL,12,Fon his friend's boat on Friday when a
OL,13,Fcar entered the water at Whitby Marina.
OL,15,F"I saw this splash come down as I stuck
OL,16,Fmy head out from under the boat and I
OL,17,Fheard someone say, 'someone's in the
OL,18,Fwater,'" said the 58-year-old.
