OL,3,GNEWSAMan working on boat carries out
OL,4,Aharbour car rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,F"After [the car] bobbed up, it looked
OL,7,Flike it was alright but [the driver]
OL,8,Fwas trying to put his window through
OL,9,Fwith his walking stick and there were
OL,10,Fhalf a dozen fellas gawping on the side
OL,11,Fof the pontoon."
